---
description: SQLite migrations and repository rules
globs: crates/forge-server/migrations/**/*.sql,crates/forge-server/src/sqlite/**/*.rs
alwaysApply: false
---

# Database

- Never edit an existing migration. Add a new numbered SQL file.
- Map `sqlx::Error` to `AppError` in this crate. Do not leak SQLx types into application or domain.
- Keep foreign keys enabled. Use `ON DELETE RESTRICT`.
- Store UTC timestamps as RFC3339 text and dates as `YYYY-MM-DD`.
- Add indexes only for actual query paths (parent FKs, `daily_executions.execution_date`).
